EXTERNAL runEvent(eventId)  

~ runEvent("Show University Camera 1")  

Bartolomeu: Ah... the ruins of the old university — what a sight to behold...  

~ runEvent("Hide University Camera 1")  

@wait_0.5  

Bartolomeu: If you ever find yourself wandering those drowned halls... tell Loras that I still remember him — and that I still owe him that drink.  
